puts herself behind bars..."],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.0],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["se","se_187"],["say","0","Several months later.",8,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_187_stop"],["bg","cavern",0,0.0],["w",0.5],["bgm","m62"],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_163","a","003",0.45,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_163","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_163","a","004","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_163","I'm ready. Shoot anytime.",0,""],["show","avg1_136","a","011",1.05,-0.3,2.0,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,0.95,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_515"],["say","avg1_136","Alright. I'm lined up.",0,""],["se","se_516"],["w",0.5],["se","se_518"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_arrow",0,2],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["ctl","avg1_163","a","008",null,0.38,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.7],["hide","avg1_136",0.7],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_163","a",null,null,0.35,-0.1,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["w",0.3],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["se","se_096"],["say","avg1_163","Ugh.",0,""],["show","avg1_136","a","008",0.8,-0.02,1.5,0,null,0.0],["se","se_072"],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,0.55,0.0,1.0,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_136","Greyhorn! Are you alright?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_163","a","005","sweaty",null,0.0,null,null,"ChanDou1","OutCubic",1.0],["se","se_208"],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_163","I'm fine. The enchanted breastplate stopped the bullet, and the padding cushioned the blow. But ... the force still felt like a battering ram to the chest.",0,""],["stg",0,50.0,-50.0,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_136","a","004","flurry",0.6,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_062"],["say","avg1_136","Impact aside, it stopped the bullet. That is a success. Can we mass-produce this for the Committee?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","a","010","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_136","The Tyrant and the Desert Scorpions are bleeding our people dry with their hit-and-run tactics.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_163","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_163","The energy cost is massive, and the effect is brief. Enchanting a full suit only buys you thirty minutes. Five casts will drain a Soul Stone completely. The cost-to-duration ratio makes it unviable for the field.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_163","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_163","Plus, armor has gaps. One lucky shot in between the plates and you are dead. Trying to ward those weak points would burn an entire Soul Stone per cast.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","a","008","symbol",0.65,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_136","An entire Soul Stone for thirty minutes? I'm no soldier, but blocking a standard magic gunshot shouldn't be that taxing.",0,""],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_163","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_163","It shouldn't. But magic guns and the Scepters of Death operate entirely differently.==W== A magic gun simply shapes magic energy into a projectile.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.15],["w",0.16],["clear",1,0,0],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["w",0.04],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.0],["show","avg3_156","a","002",null,null,-1.0,0,null,0.0],["goon"],["chd",0,0,"avg1_163","a","005",null],["ctl","avg3_156","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["say","avg1_163","Experienced fighters sense that mana spike,==W== cast a quick ward,==W== and neutralize the hit.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_034"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_magiccircle",0,1],["goon"],["w",0.7],["fx",0,"fx_avg_fire_attack",0,2],["se","se_127"],["w",0.3],["fx",0,"fx_avg_fire_attack",0,2],["se","se_127"],["goon"],["se","se_174"],["say","avg1_163","Enchanted arrows work the same way.==W== You dispel the magic aura first,==W== then parry the wooden shaft.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_156","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"ChanDou1","Linear",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_light_blade",0,1],["se","se_332"],["goon"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_arrow",0,2],["se","se_032"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_163","a","003","attention",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_163","Which brings us to the problem. The Scepter does not fire mana. It fires solid metal slugs.",0,""],["se","se_516"],["say","avg1_163","There is no mana signature to track before impact,==W== and it outpaces any arrow in both speed and power.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_518"],["ctl","avg3_156","a",null,null,0.55,null,null,null,"ChanDou1","OutQuint",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_arrow",0,0],["trn",0,1,false,false,1.0],["goon"],["say","avg1_163","Since we can't see the attacks coming,==W== we have to keep our shields on maximum mana output==W== constantly.",0,""],["w",0.9],["bg","cavern",0,0.0],["clear",1,0,0],["w",0.1],["show","avg1_136","a","004",0.65,null,null,0,null,null],["show","avg1_163","a","003",0.35,null,null,0,null,null],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_136","a","006","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_136","And we lack the time to refine the magic, or the logistics to forge better armor...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","a","010","sigh",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_136","Heh. The Tyrant has us checkmated.",0,""],["stg",0,80.0,-50.0,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["hide","avg1_136",0.5],["ctl","avg1_163","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["show","avg3_100","a","009",0.58,-0.35,1.7,0,null,0.0],["say","avg1_163","I owe you an apology, Lady Angie.==W== I didn't believe ==PLAYER_NAME== was the legendary Tyrant. I thought you were jumping to conclusions.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_100","a",null,null,0.6,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_163","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["se","se_208"],["say","avg1_163","Up until now, I was only obeying the Grand Captain. I was going through the motions of helping you, nothing more.",0,""],["chd",0,2,"avg1_136","a","004","question"],["say","avg1_136","So these recent battles changed your mind? You believe ==PLAYER_NAME== is the Tyrant now?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_163","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_163","Casualties are expected in war. That is not what convinced me.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_163","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["se","se_226"],["say","avg1_163","Flooding the cities with the Scepters of Death,==W== planting seeds of chaos across the continent...==W== Who else would orchestrate that but the Tyrant?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_100","a","006",null,null,-0.36,1.72,null,null,"InOutSine",1.0],["w",0.5],["chd",1,2,"avg1_136","a","002",null],["goon"],["w",0.7],["goon"],["show","avg1_136","a","012",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_100","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["hide","avg3_100",0.5],["bg","cavern",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_136","Is that how you see it? Then you've misjudged me, you've misjudged ==PLAYER_NAME==, and you completely misunderstand how this world would end.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_163","a","011","question",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_163","What do you mean?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","a","012",null,0.55,null,1.1,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_163","a",null,null,0.32,null,0.98,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_136","The Tyrant brought chaos, yes. But ==SEX3== actions stray entirely from the prophecy.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","a","008","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_136","Looking back, ==SEX== was never the world-ending Tyrant we thought.",0,""],["say","avg1_136","The one responsible for shaping ==SEX4== into this ... is no one else but...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_136","Me.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["clear",1,0,0],["say","0","Meanwhile, at the Omnisky Aegis Business Department in Geminia.",8,""],["w",1],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","hotel_senior_office",0,0.0],["show","avg3_198","a","008",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg3_232","a","004",0.7,-0.2,-1.0,0,null,0.0],["bgm","m42"],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_198","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg3_232","a",null,null,null,0.0,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.7],["se","se_409"],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_232","a","004","angry",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Omnisky Aegis Executive","What's all that noise downstairs?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_232","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_198","a","005","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["say","Omnisky Aegis Agent","That policyholder from earlier is back. His sister was rushed to an Eye of Grace hospital for heart palpitations and fainting. She needs surgery, and he expects us to cover the bills.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_232","a","008","shock",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","Omnisky Aegis Executive","The Eye of Grace? Does he have any idea what they charge? We are not approving that. Deny the claim.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_232","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_198","a","008","vexation",null,nu