ncel their policies every single day.",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_232","a","006",0.49,-0.7,1.8,0,null,0.0],["stg",0,100.0,-30.0,1.15,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_199","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["ctl","avg3_232","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"InOutSine",1.0],["goon"],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_199","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["goon"],["show","avg3_139","a","008",0.51,-0.67,1.8,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_232","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["hide","avg3_232",0.5],["ctl","avg3_139","a",null,null,0.52,null,null,1.0,null,"InOutSine",1.0],["ctl","avg3_198","a","004","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","Omnisky Aegis Agent","It kills me watching them walk away with nothing.==W== Anyway, why did you quit? You never told me.",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_139","a",null,null,0.53,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["hide","avg3_139",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_199","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_199","a","004","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Former Agent","Same exact crap you're dealing with now. He kept denying every claim, saying they did high-risk activities without prior approval.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_199","a","010","resentful",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","Former Agent","But my entire client list was Trekkers. Was I supposed to make them file an application and sit around waiting for days every time they climbed a Monolith?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_199","a","005","awkward",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","Former Agent","Eventually I realized it was total bullshit. I got pissed, marched up to protest, got the crap kicked out of me ... and was fired on the spot.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_198","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["se","se_251"],["bgm",""],["say","Omnisky Aegis Agent","This whole company is rotten to the core...",0,""],["show","avg3_1239","a","002",-0.1,-0.4,-1.9,0,null,0.0],["show","avg3_1240","a","002",1.1,-0.4,1.9,0,null,0.0],["show","avg3_232","a","004",null,-0.2,1.4,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_199","a","010","angry",0.68,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg3_198","a",null,null,0.32,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["stg",0,null,0.0,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["say","Former Agent","Damn right. That bastard's a parasite.==W== He took the safety net meant for everyone and turned it into his personal piggy bank.",0,""],["se","se_267"],["ctl","avg3_1239","a",null,null,-0.05,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg3_1240","a",null,null,1.05,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["w",1],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_198","a","008","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_199","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Omnisky Aegis Agent","Footsteps... It's him! Quick, hide! He's been traveling with a whole squad of armed guards lately. If he catches you, you're dead meat!",0,""],["ctl","avg3_199","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["se","se_251"],["say","Former Agent","Hide? I've been waiting for him. I came here today to settle the score once and for all.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_232","a",null,null,null,0.0,1.0,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg3_198","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["se","se_062"],["bgm","m14"],["say","Omnisky Aegis Executive","Well, well. If it isn't the trash I fired the other day.==W== What's this? You even brought a little weapon. Here for revenge?",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_232","a","006","happy",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_199","a","006","love",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","Former Agent","Hah! Revenge? Don't be silly. You took such great care of me. I'm just here to return the favor.",0,""],["stg",0,-300.0,-50.0,1.25,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","